# Documentation maintenance

When adding or changing user-facing behavior, API, auth, graph model, GEDCOM, or media:

- Update the matching files under `docs/user/` and/or `docs/dev/` in the same change set.
- Update the root `README.md` and/or `docs/README.md` if navigation or setup instructions change.
- Update checkboxes in `docs/ROADMAP.md` when closing a listed roadmap item.

Do not consider a feature complete without the corresponding documentation update, unless you explicitly note why documentation is not applicable (N/A).
